{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Esau</b> — four times in the Masorah: הסכלת עשו; למען עשה כיום הזה; עשה סטים שנאתי; עשה צדקה. Here it concerns the deceit of Laban, and likewise with Joseph — his brothers suspected him of deceit, as written: ואתם חשבתם עלי רעה. And likewise עשה סטים שנאתי — those who practice deceit in their hearts. And similarly עשה צדקה — this is Joseph, who did charity with his brothers, for they thought evil of him and he thought good of them."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:28.170657069Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}